SandMLE
=======

This repository accompanies the paper "SandMLE" and releases the reinforcement-learning
training and evaluation code for machine-learning-engineering (MLE) agents.

Bundled third-party software
----------------------------

This repository bundles and builds on the following open-source projects. Their original
licenses and copyrights apply to their respective files:

* rLLM — the reinforcement-learning framework this code runs on. The SandMLE code lives under
  `examples/deepresearch/`; the rest of the tree is rLLM, published here so the release is
  self-contained. See the upstream project and its LICENSE for terms.
  https://github.com/agentica-project/rllm

* Tongyi DeepResearch — the ReAct agent, tool-calling loop, and tool interfaces in
  `examples/deepresearch/deepresearch_agent.py`, `deepresearch_workflow.py`, and
  `deepresearch_tools.py` are adapted from Alibaba's Tongyi DeepResearch.
  https://github.com/Alibaba-NLP/DeepResearch

If you redistribute this repository, retain this NOTICE and the bundled LICENSE files.
